Kallie — AI Delivery Call Assistant 🤖

Building an AI voice agent to automate delivery coordination calls.

🎯 Problem

Delivery coordination often involves repetitive calls to confirm availability, validate delivery details, and reschedule deliveries.

💡 Solution

Kallie is an AI-powered voice assistant designed to automate delivery conversations and capture call outcomes.

🛠️ Technology Stack

* Voice AI: xAI
* Workflow Automation: n8n (planned)
* Telephony: Twilio (planned)

🚀 Current Progress

* Initial AI voice agent prototype using xAI
* Telephony integration
* Workflow automation and call outcome logging
* End-to-end demo

